@url = http://localhost:8080/api/auth

### Authenticate

POST {{url}}/authenticate HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@example.com",
    "password": "admin1."
}

### Register

POST {{url}}/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "test",
    "lastName": "example",
    "email": "test@example.com",
    "username": "testExample",
    "password": "P@ssw0rd!"
}

### Login as Admin

POST {{url}}/authenticate HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin1."
}

### Users 2-6 share the same password: P@ssw0rd!
### To login as any user 2-6, just change the email 

POST {{url}}/authenticate HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice.johnson@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd!"
}
